VALUES
  ('709989ba-3813-42bb-b959-067ca77e17d8', '7Hz Salnotes Zero', '7hz-salnotes-zero', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">7Hz Salnotes Zero</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Budget Hi-Fi In-Ear Monitor with Neutral Bright Sound & High Detail Clarity
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The 7Hz Salnotes Zero is a highly popular entry-level Hi-Fi in-ear monitor (IEM) known for its clean, neutral-bright tuning and exceptional clarity at a very affordable price.
      It uses a single 10mm dynamic driver that focuses on delivering accurate and detailed sound reproduction.
    </p>

    <p>
      Unlike bass-heavy earphones, the Salnotes Zero emphasizes clarity, separation, and natural tonality.
      This makes it ideal for users who want to hear fine details in music, vocals, instruments, and acoustic tracks.
    </p>

    <p>
      The sound signature is slightly bright, with controlled bass and forward mids, allowing vocals and instruments to stand out clearly.
      It is especially appreciated by beginners entering the audiophile world due to its reference-style tuning.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with a lightweight resin shell and metal faceplate, the earphone is comfortable for long listening sessions.
      The detachable 2-pin cable also allows easy replacement and upgrade options.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>10mm High-Performance Dynamic Driver</li>
      <li>Neutral-Bright Hi-Fi Sound Signature</li>
      <li>Excellent Instrument Separation & Clarity</li>
      <li>Detachable 2-Pin Cable System</li>
      <li>Lightweight & Comfortable Design</li>
      <li>Low Distortion Audio Output</li>
      <li>Ideal for Vocals & Acoustic Music</li>
      <li>Beginner-Friendly Audiophile IEM</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">7Hz Salnotes Zero</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic Driver</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sound Signature</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Neutral-Bright (Reference Tuning)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10Hz – 20kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">32Ω</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sensitivity</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">108 dB/mW</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Cable Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Detachable 2-Pin (0.78mm)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Connector</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">3.5mm Jack</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Build Material</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Resin Shell + Metal Faceplate</td>
