  ('6cd16694-c2de-4622-82a3-7485357eda11', '4 Pcs Handmade silk Kundan Churi | Bangle', '4-pcs-handmade-silk-kundan-churi-bangle-muk3yb9u', '<div class="product-description">

  <h2>Handmade Silk Kundan Churi | Bangle</h2>

  <p>
    Elevate your traditional style with this beautiful
    <strong>Handmade Silk Kundan Churi</strong>, thoughtfully crafted with
    premium-quality silk thread and embellished with elegant Kundan stones.
    The combination of rich silk and classic golden Kundan detailing creates
    a graceful accessory inspired by timeless South Asian craftsmanship.
  </p>

  <p>
    Each churi is <strong>handcrafted by skilled artisans</strong>, giving
    every piece its own unique detailing and luxurious finish. The rich
    <strong>purple silk base</strong> beautifully complements the
    <strong>golden Kundan work</strong>, making it an eye-catching addition
    to traditional and festive outfits.
  </p>

