  <h2>Key Features</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>100% handmade silk churi</li>
    <li>Premium Kundan stone embellishment</li>
    <li>Elegant traditional and bridal design</li>
    <li>Rich purple silk base with golden detailing</li>
    <li>Lightweight and comfortable to wear</li>
    <li>Handcrafted by skilled artisans</li>
    <li>Beautiful finishing with a luxurious appearance</li>
    <li>Suitable for traditional and festive occasions</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Design & Craftsmanship</h2>

  <p>
    The churi features a rich purple silk base decorated with classic
    <strong>golden Kundan work</strong>. Its handmade construction highlights
    the craftsmanship and cultural charm of traditional South Asian jewelry.
    Since each piece is handcrafted, subtle variations in detailing may occur,
    making every piece unique.
  </p>

  <h2>Comfort & Wearability</h2>

  <p>
    Designed to be <strong>lightweight and comfortable</strong>, this silk
    Kundan churi can be worn with traditional outfits for extended periods.
    Its elegant design makes it suitable for both special occasions and
    festive celebrations.
  </p>

  <h2>Perfect For</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Bridal wear</li>
    <li>Wedding ceremonies</li>
    <li>Mehndi and Haldi events</li>
    <li>Festivals and cultural celebrations</li>
