  ('77462105-5b8a-41a4-a7bd-8ab4f244337e', 'Soundcore R50i', 'soundcore-r50i', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Soundcore R50i</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      True Wireless Earbuds with Deep Bass, AI Clear Calls & Long Battery Life
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Soundcore R50i is a budget-friendly true wireless earbud designed to deliver powerful bass,
      clear vocals, and stable wireless connectivity for everyday entertainment.
      Equipped with 10mm dynamic drivers, it produces immersive sound with rich low frequencies and balanced audio performance.
    </p>

    <p>
      Featuring Bluetooth 5.3 technology, the earbuds provide fast pairing,
      low-latency connectivity, and reliable wireless performance for music, gaming, and video streaming.
    </p>

    <p>
      Dual AI-enhanced microphones improve voice clarity during calls by reducing surrounding noise,
      making conversations more natural and clearer even in noisy environments.
    </p>

    <p>
      With up to 10 hours of playback on a single charge and extended battery backup using the charging case,
      the Soundcore R50i is built for long listening sessions, workouts, travel, and daily use.
    </p>
