  ('130ae200-990f-43e7-9078-924e07198100', 'M10 TWS', 'm10-tws', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">M10 TWS</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Wireless Bluetooth Earbuds with LED Display & Deep Bass Sound
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The M10 TWS is a budget-friendly true wireless earbud designed for music, gaming,
      online classes, and everyday entertainment. With Bluetooth 5.1 connectivity,
      it provides stable wireless performance and quick pairing with smartphones, tablets, and laptops.
    </p>

    <p>
      Equipped with dynamic stereo drivers, the earbuds deliver deep bass,
      balanced sound, and clear vocals for an immersive listening experience.
      The ergonomic in-ear design ensures comfortable long-term usage.
    </p>

    <p>
      The smart charging case features an LED battery indicator display and can also work as a portable power backup for emergency charging support.
      Touch controls allow easy music playback, call management, and voice assistant activation.
    </p>

    <p>
      Designed for portability and convenience, the M10 TWS is suitable for workouts,
      travel, gaming, and daily communication with reliable battery performance.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
