  ('8dfef7c1-ea99-4aa7-b996-79f526d3f546', 'KZ Castor', 'kz-castor', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">KZ Castor</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Adjustable Hi-Fi In-Ear Monitor with Dual Drivers & 16 Sound Profiles
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The KZ Castor is a next-generation budget Hi-Fi in-ear monitor (IEM) designed for users who want full control over their sound experience.
      It features a dual dynamic driver system where one driver focuses on deep bass while the other handles mids and highs for better clarity and separation.
    </p>

    <p>
      One of its standout features is the 4-level tuning switch system, allowing users to customize bass and treble response.
      This creates up to 16 different sound profiles, making it highly flexible for different music genres and listening preferences.
    </p>

    <p>
      The Castor is available in Harman-tuned versions, offering a more balanced and natural sound signature with improved vocal clarity and controlled bass.
      It is suitable for both casual listeners and entry-level audiophiles.
    </p>

    <p>
      With a detachable 2-pin cable design, ergonomic resin shell, and secure in-ear fit, the KZ Castor is built for long listening sessions, gaming, and everyday use.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>Dual Dynamic Driver System for Balanced Sound</li>
      <li>4-Level Tuning Switch (Up to 16 Sound Profiles)</li>
      <li>Harman Target Sound Tuning Option</li>
      <li>Deep Bass with Clear Vocals</li>
      <li>Detachable 2-Pin Cable Design</li>
      <li>Ergonomic & Comfortable Fit</li>
      <li>Good Instrument Separation</li>
      <li>Suitable for Music, Gaming & Daily Use</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
