  ('82e204df-9707-429a-964b-89a2cace2e43', 'GearUP SL50W RGB Strip Light', 'gearup-sl50w-rgb-strip-light', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">GearUP SL50W RGB Strip Light</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Waterproof 5 Meter RGB LED Strip with App Control, Music Sync & Dynamic Lighting Effects
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The GearUP SL50W RGB Strip Light is a versatile lighting solution designed for gaming setups, bedrooms, streaming backgrounds, and modern room decoration.
      It features a 5-meter flexible RGB LED strip capable of displaying vibrant colors and multiple dynamic lighting effects.
    </p>

    <p>
      One of its main highlights is the built-in music sync functionality, which allows the lights to react to surrounding sound and music rhythm for a more immersive atmosphere.
      This makes it ideal for gaming rooms, parties, and entertainment setups.
    </p>

    <p>
      The strip light supports both mobile app control and remote control operation, allowing users to easily change colors, brightness levels, lighting modes, and effects.
      It provides convenient customization without complicated setup.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with a waterproof flexible strip design, the SL50W is suitable for indoor decoration and selected outdoor decorative use.
      The USB-powered system also makes it easy to connect with adapters, power banks, PCs, and other USB sources.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>5 Meter Flexible RGB LED Strip</li>
      <li>Music Sync Dynamic Lighting Effects</li>
      <li>Mobile App + Remote Control Support</li>
      <li>USB 5V Powered Design</li>
      <li>Waterproof Strip Construction</li>
      <li>Multiple RGB Colors & Lighting Modes</li>
      <li>Adjustable Brightness Control</li>
      <li>Ideal for Gaming Setup & Room Decoration</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
