<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:35px 20px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:20px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:40px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#111;">
      Anker Soundcore R50i
    </h1>

    <p style="font-size:18px; color:#555; max-width:820px; margin:auto;">
      The Anker Soundcore R50i delivers impressive audio quality, powerful bass,
      AI-enhanced clear calls, and long battery life in a compact and stylish design.
      Built for music lovers, gamers, students, and everyday users who want reliable premium wireless earbuds.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:35px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:18px; color:#111;">
      Key Features
    </h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:22px; font-size:16px; color:#444;">
      <li>Powerful 10mm Dynamic Drivers with Deep Bass</li>
      <li>AI Noise Reduction for Clear Calls</li>
      <li>Up to 30 Hours Total Battery Backup</li>
      <li>Bluetooth 5.3 Fast & Stable Connectivity</li>
      <li>22 Custom EQ Presets via Soundcore App</li>
      <li>Ultra-Low Latency Gaming Mode</li>
      <li>IPX5 Water Resistance for Workout & Outdoor Use</li>
      <li>Fast Charging Support with USB Type-C</li>
      <li>Lightweight & Comfortable Ergonomic Design</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:18px; color:#111;">
      Product Description
    </h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      The Anker Soundcore R50i is designed to provide an impressive wireless audio experience
      with strong bass, clear vocals, and stable connectivity at an affordable price point.
      Equipped with 10mm dynamic drivers, these earbuds deliver rich and punchy sound
      that makes music, movies, and gaming more immersive.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      The earbuds feature AI-powered microphones that help reduce background noise during calls,
      allowing your voice to sound clearer even in noisy environments.
      With Bluetooth 5.3 technology, users can enjoy stable connections,
      lower latency, and smooth audio synchronization while gaming or watching videos.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Using the Soundcore app, users can customize their listening experience with multiple EQ presets,
      including bass boost, vocal enhancement, and gaming modes.
      The ergonomic lightweight design ensures a comfortable fit during long listening sessions,
      workouts, or travel.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      With up to 30 hours of total battery life and fast charging support,
      the Soundcore R50i is built for all-day entertainment and productivity.
      Its IPX5 water resistance also makes it suitable for workouts, jogging, and outdoor activities.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:20px; color:#111;">
      Specifications
    </h2>

    <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
      <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">

        <tr style="background:#111; color:white;">
          <th style="padding:14px; text-align:left;">Specification</th>
          <th style="padding:14px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
        </tr>

        <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Product Type</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">True Wireless Stereo (TWS)</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Size</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic Drivers</td>
        </tr>

        <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Bluetooth Version</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Bluetooth 5.3</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Battery Life</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10 Hours (Earbuds), Up to 30 Hours with Case</td>
        </tr>

        <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Fast Charging</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10 Minutes Charge = 2 Hours Playback</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Microphone</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Dual AI Noise Reduction Mics</td>
        </tr>

        <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Water Resistance</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">IPX5 Sweat & Splash Resistant</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">App Support</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Soundcore App with 22 EQ Presets</td>
        </tr>

        <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Charging Port</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">USB Type-C</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Special Features</td>
          <td style="padding:12px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Gaming Mode, Custom EQ, Fast Pairing</td>
        </tr>

      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>', 1600, NULL, '4e14167f-2d43-4532-a1ae-1d7ac9b23d7c', NULL, '["https://res.cloudinary.com/do56bvtzt/image/upload/v1791129987/stellar-mart/products/product_f911baea-e72f-4127-bc1a-370d35f95900_img_0.jpg"]'::jsonb, 200, NULL, NULL, 'active', FALSE, '[]'::jsonb, 0, 0, 0, '2026-05-08T07:10:19.493298', '2026-09-22T10:50:23.367', NULL, NULL, NULL, FALSE, FALSE, 0, 0, 1600, 0, 200, 'in_stock', 'https://res.cloudinary.com/do56bvtzt/image/upload/v1791129985/stellar-mart/products/product_f911baea-e72f-4127-bc1a-370d35f95900_featured.jpg', TRUE, FALSE, '[]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '<!-- =========================
