<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:35px 20px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:20px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:40px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#111;">
      Redmi Buds 6
    </h1>

    <p style="font-size:18px; color:#555; max-width:820px; margin:auto;">
      Redmi Buds 6 delivers premium wireless sound with advanced Active Noise Cancellation,
      immersive 360° audio, powerful dual-driver acoustics, and long-lasting battery life.
      Designed for music lovers, gamers, students, and everyday entertainment.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:35px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:18px; color:#111;">
      Key Features
    </h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:22px; font-size:16px; color:#444;">
      <li>Dual-Driver Acoustic System for rich and detailed sound</li>
      <li>Up to 49dB Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</li>
      <li>360° Spatial Audio for immersive listening</li>
      <li>Bluetooth 5.4 fast and stable connectivity</li>
      <li>Up to 42 Hours Total Battery Life</li>
      <li>AI Dual-Mic Noise Reduction for clear calls</li>
      <li>Low Latency Gaming Mode</li>
      <li>IP54 Dust & Water Resistance</li>
      <li>Fast USB Type-C Charging Support</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:18px; color:#111;">
      Product Description
    </h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      The Redmi Buds 6 is designed to deliver an impressive wireless audio experience
      with deep bass, detailed vocals, and immersive surround sound.
      Featuring a dual-driver acoustic architecture with a large 12.4mm titanium-coated driver
      and an additional ceramic micro-unit, these earbuds produce rich and balanced sound
      for music, movies, gaming, and calls.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Equipped with advanced Active Noise Cancellation technology,
      Redmi Buds 6 can reduce external noise by up to 49dB,
      helping users stay focused in busy environments.
      Transparency mode also allows outside sound to pass through naturally when needed.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      The earbuds support immersive 360° spatial audio,
      creating a more cinematic and realistic listening experience.
      Gamers will also enjoy low-latency audio performance for smoother gameplay synchronization.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      With up to 42 hours of total battery backup,
      Bluetooth 5.4 connectivity, AI-enhanced microphones,
      and IP54 water resistance, Redmi Buds 6 is built for all-day entertainment,
      workouts, travel, and everyday use.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:40px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:20px; color:#111;">
