  ('cefc4ddc-255c-46b9-aa5c-f369eab57cac', 'KZ ZSN Pro X', 'kz-zsn-pro-x', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">KZ ZSN Pro X</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Hybrid Hi-Fi In-Ear Monitor with Powerful Bass, Clear Treble & Detachable Cable
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The KZ ZSN Pro X is a highly popular hybrid in-ear monitor (IEM) designed for users who want a powerful yet detailed sound experience at a budget-friendly price.
      It combines a 10mm dual-magnetic dynamic driver with a balanced armature unit, delivering a rich mix of deep bass and clear high frequencies.
    </p>

    <p>
      The sound signature is V-shaped, meaning the bass and treble are enhanced while maintaining clear vocals.
      This makes it ideal for energetic music genres like EDM, hip-hop, and also gaming where directional audio matters.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with a metal faceplate and resin shell, the design is both stylish and durable.
      The ergonomic shape ensures a secure and comfortable fit, even during long listening or gaming sessions.
    </p>

    <p>
      With a detachable 2-pin cable system, users can easily upgrade or replace the cable, including options for Bluetooth modules for wireless use.
      This makes the ZSN Pro X a flexible and long-term audio solution.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>Hybrid Driver System (10mm DD + Balanced Armature)</li>
      <li>Powerful V-Shaped Sound Signature</li>
      <li>Deep Bass with Clear Treble Detail</li>
      <li>Detachable 2-Pin Cable Design</li>
      <li>Metal + Resin Premium Build</li>
      <li>Ergonomic & Comfortable Fit</li>
      <li>Upgrade Support (Bluetooth Module Compatible)</li>
      <li>Suitable for Music & Gaming</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">KZ ZSN Pro X</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic + Balanced Armature</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sound Signature</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">V-Shaped (Bass & Treble Boost)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">7Hz – 40kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">25Ω</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
