  ('d9cd73be-6921-49c1-ba5e-80db12e5db4a', 'CCA CRA', 'cca-cra', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">CCA CRA</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Hi-Fi In-Ear Monitor with Deep Bass, Clear Treble & Lightweight Design
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The CCA CRA is a budget-friendly Hi-Fi in-ear monitor designed for users who want powerful sound performance at an affordable price.
      It features a 10mm dynamic driver that delivers strong bass impact along with clear and detailed treble response.
    </p>

    <p>
      The earphones are tuned with a V-shaped sound signature, enhancing bass and treble while keeping vocals clear.
      This makes it suitable for energetic music genres like EDM, hip-hop, and gaming environments where sound clarity is important.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with a lightweight resin shell and ergonomic design, the CCA CRA ensures a comfortable fit even during long listening sessions.
      It reduces ear fatigue and provides good passive noise isolation.
    </p>

    <p>
      With a detachable 2-pin cable system, users can easily replace or upgrade the cable, making it a durable and customizable audio solution for long-term use.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>10mm High-Performance Dynamic Driver</li>
      <li>V-Shaped Sound Signature (Bass + Treble Boost)</li>
      <li>Clear Vocals with Strong Bass Impact</li>
      <li>Detachable 2-Pin Cable Design</li>
      <li>Lightweight & Comfortable Fit</li>
      <li>Good Passive Noise Isolation</li>
      <li>Budget Hi-Fi Audio Experience</li>
      <li>Suitable for Music & Gaming</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">CCA CRA</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic Driver</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sound Signature</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">V-Shaped (Bass & Treble Boost)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">20Hz – 20kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
