  ('e86252c8-ce39-44f9-9b9b-31a7fb811a09', 'Plextone G20', 'plextone-g20', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Plextone G20</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Gaming In-Ear Earphones with Deep Bass, Magnetic Design & Noise Isolation
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Plextone G20 is a popular gaming earphone designed for mobile gamers who want strong bass, clear footsteps, and immersive sound direction.
      It comes with a 10mm dynamic driver that delivers powerful low-frequency performance, making in-game sounds more detailed and impactful.
    </p>

    <p>
      Its side-tuned acoustic design enhances bass response while improving sound clarity for competitive gaming.
      This makes it especially useful for FPS games where footsteps and directional audio are important.
    </p>

    <p>
      The earphones feature a magnetic design that allows easy storage when not in use, along with a comfortable in-ear fit for long gaming sessions.
      The built-in microphone ensures clear communication with teammates during gameplay or calls.
    </p>

    <p>
      With a durable wired connection, long cable support, and ergonomic design, the Plextone G20 is suitable for mobile gaming, PC gaming, and everyday entertainment.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>10mm Dynamic Drivers with Enhanced Bass</li>
      <li>Magnetic Earbud Design for Easy Carrying</li>
      <li>Gaming-Optimized Sound for Footsteps & Effects</li>
      <li>Noise-Isolating In-Ear Fit</li>
      <li>Clear Built-in Microphone</li>
      <li>Durable Wired Connection</li>
      <li>Comfortable for Long Gaming Sessions</li>
      <li>Compatible with Mobile & PC Devices</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Plextone G20</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Product Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Wired Gaming Earphones</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Size</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic Driver</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">20Hz – 20kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sensitivity</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">102dB</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">32Ω</td>
