  ('b3b5af14-e3a4-463e-8842-f64b258594bf', 'KZ EDX Pro', 'kz-edx-pro', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">KZ EDX Pro</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Budget Hi-Fi In-Ear Monitor with Deep Bass, V-Shaped Sound & Detachable Cable
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The KZ EDX Pro is a highly popular budget in-ear monitor (IEM) designed for users who want energetic sound performance at an affordable price.
      It features a 10mm dynamic driver that produces strong bass response, making music and gaming more engaging and impactful.
    </p>

    <p>
      Its V-shaped sound signature emphasizes bass and treble, delivering a lively and exciting audio experience.
      This makes it suitable for genres like EDM, hip-hop, and gaming where punchy sound effects are important.
    </p>

    <p>
      The earphones come with a detachable 2-pin cable design, allowing easy replacement or upgrades for better durability and customization.
      The lightweight resin shell ensures a comfortable fit for long listening sessions.
    </p>

    <p>
      Overall, the KZ EDX Pro is one of the most value-for-money IEMs in its category, offering solid performance for beginners and budget audio enthusiasts.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>10mm Dynamic Driver with Powerful Bass</li>
      <li>V-Shaped Sound Signature (Bass & Treble Boost)</li>
      <li>Detachable 2-Pin Cable Design</li>
      <li>Lightweight & Comfortable Resin Shell</li>
      <li>Clear Highs with Energetic Sound Output</li>
      <li>Easy to Drive with Any Device</li>
      <li>Budget-Friendly Hi-Fi Experience</li>
      <li>Suitable for Music & Gaming</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">KZ EDX Pro</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic Driver</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sound Signature</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">V-Shaped (Bass & Treble Boost)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10Hz – 20kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">24Ω</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sensitivity</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">112 dB/mW</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Cable Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Detachable 2-Pin (0.75mm)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Connector</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">3.5mm Jack</td>
