  ('39dfc25a-ce9f-4be2-88c1-7178151f0f9f', 'Onikuma K5', 'onikuma-k5', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Onikuma K5</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Budget Gaming Headset with 50mm Drivers, RGB Lighting & Noise-Canceling Mic
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Onikuma K5 is a popular budget gaming headset designed for gamers who want powerful sound and clear communication without spending too much.
      It features large 50mm dynamic drivers that deliver strong bass and immersive in-game audio for FPS and action games.
    </p>

    <p>
      The sound profile is slightly bass-boosted, making explosions, footsteps, and game effects more intense and exciting.
      While it is not studio-grade audio, it provides a very enjoyable gaming experience in its price range.
    </p>

    <p>
      The headset includes a noise-reducing adjustable microphone that helps capture clear voice during gaming chats and online calls.
      It is suitable for team communication in games like PUBG, Free Fire, and Call of Duty Mobile.
    </p>

    <p>
      With soft over-ear cushions, adjustable headband, and RGB lighting effects, the K5 is designed for long gaming sessions with a stylish look and decent comfort.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>50mm High-Precision Dynamic Drivers</li>
      <li>Deep Bass Gaming Sound Experience</li>
      <li>Noise-Reducing Adjustable Microphone</li>
      <li>RGB LED Lighting Effects</li>
      <li>Over-Ear Comfortable Design</li>
      <li>In-Line Volume Control</li>
      <li>Strong Build for Gaming Use</li>
      <li>Compatible with PC, PS, Mobile & Console</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Onikuma K5</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Size</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">50mm Dynamic Drivers</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">20Hz – 20kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">16Ω</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Microphone</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Noise-Reducing Flexible Mic</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Connectivity</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">3.5mm Jack + USB (RGB)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Lighting</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">RGB LED Effects</td>
      </tr>

