  ('5a58d254-9887-4d43-86b5-bce589d58fc3', 'Fantech HG11', 'fantech-hg11', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Fantech HG11 Captain 7.1</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Gaming Headset with Virtual 7.1 Surround Sound, 50mm Drivers & RGB Lighting
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Fantech HG11 Captain 7.1 is a budget-friendly gaming headset designed to deliver immersive gaming audio with virtual 7.1 surround sound.
      It is equipped with large 50mm drivers that provide powerful bass, clear mids, and detailed in-game sound effects.
    </p>

    <p>
      With its 7.1 virtual surround technology, players can easily detect enemy movement, footsteps, and direction-based audio cues,
      making it highly useful for FPS and competitive games like PUBG, Valorant, and Call of Duty.
    </p>

    <p>
      The headset features an adjustable noise-canceling microphone that ensures clear voice communication during team gameplay and online meetings.
      It reduces background noise for better team coordination.
    </p>

    <p>
      Designed for comfort, the HG11 includes soft over-ear cushions, an adjustable headband, and durable build quality.
      The RGB lighting adds a stylish gaming aesthetic, enhancing your setup experience.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>Virtual 7.1 Surround Sound for Immersive Gaming</li>
      <li>50mm High-Quality Driver Units</li>
      <li>Noise-Canceling Adjustable Microphone</li>
      <li>RGB Lighting Effects</li>
      <li>Over-Ear Comfortable Design</li>
      <li>Strong Bass and Clear Audio Balance</li>
      <li>USB Wired Connectivity</li>
      <li>Ideal for PC and Gaming Consoles</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
