  ('c582dd2d-0f53-4892-844c-abfa11321ea8', 'Redragon H120', 'redragon-h120', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Redragon H120</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Budget Gaming Headset with Clear Stereo Sound & Noise-Reducing Microphone
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Redragon H120 is an entry-level gaming headset designed for users who want simple, reliable, and affordable gaming audio.
      It delivers clear stereo sound with enhanced bass response, making it suitable for casual gaming, online meetings, and multimedia use.
    </p>

    <p>
      The headset focuses on balanced sound output rather than heavy bass boosting, allowing users to hear game effects, dialogue, and background audio clearly.
      This makes it a good choice for beginners and everyday gamers.
    </p>

    <p>
      It comes with a noise-reducing adjustable microphone that helps improve voice clarity during in-game communication and online calls.
      The mic is designed to reduce background noise for smoother teamwork in multiplayer games.
    </p>

    <p>
      With its lightweight build, adjustable headband, and soft ear cushions, the H120 is comfortable for long sessions.
      Its simple plug-and-play design ensures easy compatibility with PCs, laptops, and other 3.5mm-supported devices.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>Clear Stereo Gaming Sound Output</li>
      <li>Enhanced Bass for Immersive Experience</li>
      <li>Noise-Reducing Adjustable Microphone</li>
      <li>Lightweight Over-Ear Design</li>
      <li>Soft Ear Cushions for Comfort</li>
      <li>Adjustable Headband Fit</li>
      <li>Plug & Play 3.5mm Connectivity</li>
      <li>Ideal for Gaming, Study & Calls</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

