  ('0e08da9d-4b78-438a-9b9e-46df92f24e98', 'GearUP NRGB50 Neon RGB Light', 'gearup-nrgb50-neon-rgb-light', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">GearUP NRGB50 Neon RGB Light</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Smart RGB Neon LED Strip with App Control, Music Sync & Dynamic Lighting Effects
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The GearUP NRGB50 Neon RGB Light is a premium decorative lighting solution designed for gaming setups, bedrooms, streaming backgrounds, and modern interior decoration.
      It features a flexible 5-meter neon-style RGB LED strip capable of producing vibrant colors and smooth lighting diffusion.
    </p>

    <p>
      The lighting system supports smartphone app control and remote control functionality, allowing users to customize colors, brightness, dynamic effects, and lighting modes with ease.
      Users can create personalized ambiance for gaming, entertainment, or relaxation.
    </p>

    <p>
      One of its key highlights is the built-in music sync mode, where the lights react dynamically to surrounding sound and music rhythm for a more immersive atmosphere.
      This feature is especially popular for gaming rooms, parties, and streaming setups.
    </p>

    <p>
      The neon-style diffused lighting provides a smoother and more premium glow compared to traditional RGB strips.
      Its flexible waterproof design also allows easy installation on walls, desks, shelves, ceilings, and furniture.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>5 Meter Flexible RGB Neon LED Strip</li>
      <li>Smartphone App + Remote Control Support</li>
      <li>Music Sync Dynamic Lighting Mode</li>
      <li>Smooth Neon-Style Diffused Lighting</li>
      <li>Multiple RGB Effects & Color Modes</li>
      <li>Waterproof Flexible Design</li>
      <li>Easy Installation with Adhesive Support</li>
      <li>Ideal for Gaming Setup & Room Decoration</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

