  ('6da94230-bfd8-4add-a0c5-e89ec94c934c', 'Moondrop Chu II', 'moondrop-chu-ii', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Moondrop Chu II</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Budget Hi-Fi In-Ear Monitor with VDSF Tuning, Metal Build & High Detail Sound
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Moondrop Chu II is one of the most popular entry-level Hi-Fi in-ear monitors, designed for users who want accurate and detailed sound at a very affordable price.
      It uses a 10mm high-performance dynamic driver with an aluminum-magnesium alloy composite diaphragm, delivering clean bass, clear mids, and extended treble.
    </p>

    <p>
      Tuned based on Moondrop’s VDSF target response, the Chu II provides a balanced yet slightly V-shaped sound signature that maintains natural tonality while improving excitement in music and gaming.
    </p>

    <p>
      The build quality is premium for its price, featuring a zinc alloy metal shell and brass nozzle design for better durability and acoustic precision.
      It also includes replaceable acoustic filters for sound tuning and maintenance flexibility.
    </p>

    <p>
      With a detachable 2-pin cable system and lightweight ergonomic design, the Chu II ensures long-term comfort and upgradeability, making it a top choice for beginners in Hi-Fi audio.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>10mm Aluminum-Magnesium Alloy Dynamic Driver</li>
      <li>VDSF Target Tuning for Balanced Sound</li>
      <li>Low Distortion High-Resolution Audio</li>
      <li>Metal Zinc Alloy Shell Build</li>
      <li>Replaceable Acoustic Filters</li>
      <li>Detachable 2-Pin Cable System</li>
      <li>Clear Bass, Mids & Extended Treble</li>
      <li>Comfortable Ergonomic Fit</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Moondrop Chu II</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic Driver</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Diaphragm</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Aluminum-Magnesium Alloy Composite</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sound Tuning</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">VDSF Target Response</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">15Hz – 38kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">18Ω</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sensitivity</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">119 dB/Vrms</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Cable Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Detachable 2-Pin (0.78mm)</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Shell Material</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Zinc Alloy Metal</td>
      </tr>

