  ('e1b91878-f8c8-45bc-a2f6-e1bafb1619ba', 'Nanoleaf Shapes', 'nanoleaf-shapes', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Nanoleaf Shapes</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Modular Smart RGB Wall Lighting System with Music Sync & Touch Controls
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      Nanoleaf Shapes is a premium smart lighting system designed to transform gaming rooms, streaming setups, bedrooms, and creative workspaces with vibrant modular RGB lighting.
      The panels can be arranged into unique patterns and customized layouts to match personal style and room aesthetics.
    </p>

    <p>
      The lighting system supports millions of colors and dynamic animated scenes, allowing users to create immersive atmospheres for gaming, entertainment, relaxation, and productivity.
      It also includes music sync technology that reacts to sound and rhythm in real time.
    </p>

    <p>
      Nanoleaf Shapes features touch-reactive controls, enabling users to interact directly with the wall panels for lighting changes and animations.
      The smart system also supports app control and voice assistant compatibility for convenient operation.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with a modern minimalist design, the modular panels can be expanded and rearranged easily.
      Its edge-to-edge illumination creates a premium floating light effect that enhances any gaming or smart home environment.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>Modular RGB Smart Wall Lighting Panels</li>
      <li>Millions of Customizable Colors</li>
      <li>Music Sync Reactive Lighting Effects</li>
      <li>Touch-Reactive Interactive Controls</li>
      <li>App & Voice Assistant Support</li>
      <li>Dynamic Animated Lighting Scenes</li>
      <li>Expandable Modular Design</li>
      <li>Ideal for Gaming, Streaming & Smart Rooms</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
