  ('a5a24745-4c3d-4adf-88e4-5c899b0267c3', 'Logitech G102 Lightsync', 'logitech-g102-lightsync', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Logitech G102 Lightsync</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Gaming Mouse with 8000 DPI Sensor, RGB Lightsync & Ultra-Responsive Clicks
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Logitech G102 Lightsync is a popular entry-level gaming mouse designed for smooth and precise control in competitive gaming.
      It features a high-precision 8000 DPI optical sensor that delivers accurate tracking and consistent performance.
    </p>

    <p>
      With customizable RGB Lightsync technology, users can personalize lighting effects to match their gaming setup or mood.
      The lighting can be synchronized with games, music, or screen content for a more immersive experience.
    </p>

    <p>
      The mouse is built with a lightweight and ergonomic design, making it comfortable for long gaming sessions.
      Its mechanical button tensioning system ensures crisp and responsive clicks for faster reactions in FPS and MOBA games.
    </p>

    <p>
      Designed for both casual and competitive gamers, the G102 offers plug-and-play simplicity with Logitech’s reliable build quality,
      making it a trusted choice for everyday gaming and productivity use.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>8000 DPI High-Precision Optical Sensor</li>
      <li>RGB Lightsync Customizable Lighting</li>
      <li>Mechanical Button Tensioning System</li>
      <li>Lightweight Ergonomic Design</li>
      <li>Ultra-Responsive Click Performance</li>
      <li>6 Programmable Buttons</li>
      <li>Plug & Play USB Connectivity</li>
      <li>Ideal for FPS, MOBA & Daily Use</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
