  ('16ec9736-6e3b-430d-a585-8be89944ce0f', 'Handmade Silk Kundan Churi Bangle Set | Designer Bridal Bangles', 'handmade-silk-kundan-churi-bangle-set-designer-bridal-bangles-muk4kss2', '<h2>Handmade Silk Kundan Churi Bangle Set – Red, Lavender &amp; Ivory</h2>

<p>
Add timeless elegance to your traditional jewelry collection with this
<strong>Handmade Silk Kundan Churi Bangle Set</strong>. Beautifully handcrafted
using premium silk thread and detailed Kundan stone embellishments, this set
combines traditional charm with a sophisticated modern look.
</p>

<p>
The graceful <strong>red, lavender, and ivory</strong> color combination makes
these bangles versatile enough to complement sarees, lehengas, salwar suits,
and other festive ethnic outfits. Each bangle features carefully crafted
floral and geometric Kundan motifs that create an elegant sparkle.
</p>

<p>
Designed to be <strong>lightweight and comfortable</strong>, the smooth silk
finish makes these bangles suitable for extended wear during weddings,
celebrations, and cultural events. Each piece is carefully handcrafted by
skilled artisans, giving the set a unique and refined appearance.
</p>

<h3>✨ Key Features</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Handmade silk Kundan churi bangle set</li>
  <li>Premium silk thread with intricate Kundan embellishments</li>
  <li>Elegant red, lavender &amp; ivory color combination</li>
  <li>Beautiful floral and geometric Kundan motifs</li>
  <li>Lightweight and comfortable for long hours of wear</li>
  <li>Skin-friendly smooth silk finish</li>
  <li>Suitable for bridal, wedding and festive occasions</li>
  <li>Durable finish with attractive long-lasting shine</li>
  <li>Ideal for brides, bridesmaids and ethnic jewelry lovers</li>
</ul>

