  ('04ee2b78-79a4-442c-a15c-93e24a518748', 'Havit H2002D', 'havit-h2002d', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Havit H2002D</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Budget Gaming Headset with 53mm Drivers, Deep Bass & Detachable Microphone
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Havit H2002D is a popular budget gaming headset designed for gamers who want powerful sound performance and clear communication at an affordable price.
      It features large 53mm dynamic drivers that deliver strong bass and immersive audio, making it ideal for FPS, battle royale, and action games.
    </p>

    <p>
      The sound signature is slightly bass-focused, enhancing explosions, footsteps, and in-game effects for a more engaging gaming experience.
      It also provides decent stereo separation for casual competitive gaming.
    </p>

    <p>
      The headset includes a detachable noise-reducing microphone that ensures clear voice transmission during gaming, streaming, and online meetings.
      This makes it suitable for communication-heavy games like PUBG, Free Fire, and Valorant.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with a metal-reinforced headband and soft ear cushions, the H2002D offers good comfort for long sessions.
      Its simple wired design ensures stable connectivity without lag or battery issues.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>53mm High-Performance Dynamic Drivers</li>
      <li>Deep Bass Gaming Audio Experience</li>
      <li>Detachable Noise-Reducing Microphone</li>
      <li>Over-Ear Comfortable Design</li>
      <li>Metal Reinforced Headband</li>
      <li>Stereo Sound with Good Separation</li>
      <li>Plug & Play 3.5mm Connectivity</li>
      <li>Ideal for PC, Console & Mobile Gaming</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

