  ('9aab508c-ee74-4d1f-8809-d39da863305b', 'Plextone EX2 Pro', 'plextone-ex2-pro', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Plextone EX2 Pro</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Magnetic Semiconductor Phone Cooler for Ultimate Gaming Performance
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Plextone EX2 Pro is a high-performance mobile phone cooling system designed for gamers who demand stable FPS and zero overheating issues.
      It uses advanced semiconductor cooling technology to rapidly reduce device temperature during heavy gaming.
    </p>

    <p>
      With its strong magnetic attachment system, it easily connects to your smartphone for instant cooling.
      The upgraded aluminum heat sink improves heat dissipation efficiency, ensuring long gaming sessions without performance drops.
    </p>

    <p>
      RGB lighting adds a stylish gaming vibe while maintaining silent operation for distraction-free use.
      It is lightweight, portable, and perfect for PUBG, Free Fire, COD Mobile, and other high-performance games.
    </p>

    <p>
      Built with durable ABS + aluminum alloy materials, the EX2 Pro ensures long-lasting performance with stable cooling efficiency.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>10W Semiconductor Cooling Technology</li>
      <li>Magnetic Fast Attachment System</li>
      <li>RGB Lighting Effects</li>
      <li>Low Noise Silent Operation</li>
      <li>Enhanced Aluminum Heat Dissipation</li>
      <li>Stable FPS for Gaming</li>
      <li>Portable & Lightweight Design</li>
      <li>Type-C Power Input</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

