  ('fa4e1314-a69d-49ce-9d6b-8033fb4eb8a9', 'FONENG BL118 MVP', 'foneng-bl118-mvp', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">FONENG BL118 MVP</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Gaming TWS Earbuds with Bluetooth 5.3 & Low Latency Audio
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The FONENG BL118 MVP is a stylish true wireless gaming earbud designed for immersive sound,
      stable connectivity, and smooth gaming performance. Powered by Bluetooth 5.3 technology,
      it delivers fast pairing and reliable wireless performance for gaming, music, and entertainment.
    </p>

    <p>
      Featuring low-latency audio transmission, the BL118 MVP helps improve synchronization between sound and gameplay,
      making it suitable for mobile games like Free Fire, PUBG Mobile, and Call of Duty Mobile.
    </p>

    <p>
      Equipped with powerful stereo sound and deep bass tuning, the earbuds provide an immersive listening experience
      for music, movies, and gaming sessions. The ergonomic lightweight design ensures comfortable long-term usage.
    </p>

    <p>
      With extended battery backup, Type-C charging support, and stylish gaming aesthetics,
      the FONENG BL118 MVP is built for everyday entertainment and competitive gaming.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>Bluetooth 5.3 Fast & Stable Connectivity</li>
      <li>Low Latency Gaming Performance</li>
      <li>Immersive Stereo Sound with Deep Bass</li>
      <li>Up to 40 Hours Total Battery Backup</li>
      <li>Stylish Gaming Design</li>
      <li>Comfortable Lightweight Fit</li>
      <li>USB Type-C Charging Support</li>
      <li>Wide Device Compatibility</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
