  ('4373bf9f-6ba6-4352-9761-a762cd8d2886', 'Handmade Silk Kundan Churi Bangle Set | Golden & Purple Bangles', 'handmade-silk-kundan-churi-bangle-set-golden-purple-bangles-muk4n6j5', '<h2>Handmade Silk Kundan Churi Bangle Set – Golden &amp; Purple</h2>

<p>
Add a royal touch to your ethnic jewelry collection with this
<strong>Handmade Silk Kundan Churi Bangle Set</strong>. Crafted with premium
silk thread and elegant Kundan stone detailing, this beautiful set combines
traditional craftsmanship with a luxurious contemporary appearance.
</p>

<p>
The rich <strong>golden yellow and deep purple</strong> color combination
creates a bold yet graceful look that beautifully complements sarees,
lehengas, salwar suits, and other traditional outfits. The intricate
leaf-inspired and geometric Kundan motifs add an elegant decorative touch.
</p>

<p>
Each bangle is carefully <strong>handcrafted by skilled artisans</strong>.
The smooth silk thread finish makes the bangles lightweight and comfortable,
allowing you to wear them for long hours during weddings, festivals, and
special celebrations.
</p>

<h3>✨ Key Features</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Handmade silk Kundan churi bangle set</li>
  <li>Premium silk thread with detailed Kundan work</li>
  <li>Rich golden yellow and deep purple color combination</li>
  <li>Beautiful leaf-inspired and geometric Kundan motifs</li>
  <li>Lightweight and comfortable for extended wear</li>
  <li>Smooth and skin-friendly silk thread finish</li>
  <li>Ideal for bridal, wedding and festive occasions</li>
  <li>Durable finish with attractive long-lasting shine</li>
  <li>Suitable for traditional and ethnic outfits</li>
</ul>

<h3>📋 Product Specifications</h3>
<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Product Type</th>
    <td>Silk Kundan Churi Bangle Set</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Material</th>
    <td>Silk Thread &amp; Kundan Stones</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Color</th>
    <td>Golden Yellow &amp; Deep Purple</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Design</th>
    <td>Leaf-Inspired &amp; Geometric Kundan Motifs</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Finish</th>
    <td>Smooth Silk Thread Finish</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Style</th>
    <td>Traditional, Royal &amp; Ethnic</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <th>Handmade</th>
    <td>Yes</td>
  </tr>
