    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Black Shark FunCooler 4</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Advanced Semiconductor Gaming Phone Cooler with RGB Lighting
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Black Shark FunCooler 4 is a high-performance mobile phone cooling accessory engineered for gamers and power users.
      Using advanced semiconductor cooling technology, it rapidly lowers device temperature to prevent overheating during heavy gaming sessions.
    </p>

    <p>
      Equipped with an upgraded high-speed fan and aluminum heat dissipation system, the cooler helps maintain stable FPS and smoother gameplay.
      It is ideal for PUBG Mobile, Free Fire, Call of Duty Mobile, Genshin Impact, and other demanding mobile games.
    </p>

    <p>
      The stylish RGB lighting design adds a premium gaming aesthetic while the low-noise cooling system ensures distraction-free operation.
      Its lightweight and portable build makes it easy to carry anywhere.
    </p>

    <p>
      With universal smartphone compatibility and Type-C power support, Black Shark FunCooler 4 delivers efficient cooling performance for long gaming and streaming sessions.
    </p>
