  ('1dadbb3f-ea59-4147-b154-2678dbf7f3b3', 'Plextone G30', 'plextone-g30', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Plextone G30</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Budget Gaming In-Ear Headset with Detachable Mic & Deep Bass Performance
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Plextone G30 is a budget gaming in-ear headset designed specifically for gamers who want strong bass, clear communication, and an immersive sound experience at an affordable price.
      It features a 10mm dynamic driver that produces powerful low-frequency output, making explosions, footsteps, and in-game effects more intense.
    </p>

    <p>
      The sound signature is bass-heavy, which enhances gaming immersion especially in FPS and battle royale titles.
      While bass is dominant, it still provides a decent soundstage for positional awareness in competitive games.
    </p>

    <p>
      One of its key highlights is the detachable boom microphone, which improves voice clarity during gaming chats and online communication.
      This makes it more flexible compared to standard built-in mic earphones.
    </p>

    <p>
      The earphones include ear hooks for secure fit, multiple accessories, and extended cable options for PC usage.
      Its ergonomic in-ear design ensures better noise isolation and comfort during long gaming sessions.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>10mm Dynamic Driver with Deep Bass Output</li>
      <li>Detachable Boom Microphone for Clear Voice</li>
      <li>Gaming-Focused Soundstage for FPS Awareness</li>
      <li>Ear Hook Design for Stable Fit</li>
      <li>Multiple Accessories Included (Tips & Extension Cable)</li>
      <li>Good Noise Isolation</li>
      <li>3.5mm Universal Compatibility</li>
      <li>Ideal for Mobile & PC Gaming</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Model</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Plextone G30</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Driver Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">10mm Dynamic Driver</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sound Signature</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Bass-Heavy Gaming Tuning</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Frequency Range</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">20Hz – 20kHz</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Impedance</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">32Ω</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Sensitivity</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">~105 dB</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Microphone</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Detachable Boom Mic</td>
      </tr>

      <tr style="background:#f9f9f9;">
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Connectivity</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">3.5mm Jack</td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Cable Type</td>
        <td style="padding:10px; border:1px solid #ddd;">Flat Cable + Extension Support</td>
