  ('ebd964c5-60a8-4390-b128-88e06f176b64', 'Arduino Uno R3', 'arduino-uno-r3-mufnhm20', '<div class="product-description">

  <h2>Arduino Uno R3 High-Quality Edition</h2>

  <p>
    The <strong>Arduino Uno R3 High-Quality Edition</strong> is a reliable
    microcontroller development board based on the <strong>ATmega328</strong>.
    It is designed for electronics projects, robotics, automation, STEM
    education, prototyping, and embedded system development.
  </p>

  <p>
    This board provides <strong>14 digital input/output pins</strong>,
    including <strong>6 PWM outputs</strong>, along with
    <strong>6 analog input pins</strong>. It operates at 5V and features a
    <strong>16 MHz</strong> clock speed for running Arduino programs and
    controlling connected electronic components.
  </p>

  <p>
    The Arduino Uno R3 can be powered through USB or an external power supply.
    Its USB interface also allows convenient programming and serial
    communication with a computer. A <strong>USB programming cable is included</strong>
    with the product.
  </p>


  <h2>Technical Specifications</h2>

