<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:35px 20px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:20px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:40px; margin-bottom:12px; color:#111;">
      Apple AirPods Pro 3
    </h1>

    <p style="font-size:18px; color:#555; max-width:820px; margin:auto;">
      Apple AirPods Pro 3 delivers a next-level wireless audio experience with powerful Active Noise Cancellation,
      immersive Spatial Audio, enhanced comfort, and intelligent smart features.
      Designed for premium everyday listening, gaming, workouts, and crystal-clear communication.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:35px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:18px; color:#111;">
      Key Features
    </h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:22px; font-size:16px; color:#444;">
      <li>Advanced Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</li>
      <li>Adaptive Audio & Transparency Mode</li>
      <li>Personalized Spatial Audio with Dynamic Head Tracking</li>
      <li>Premium sound quality with deep bass and clear vocals</li>
      <li>Comfortable secure-fit silicone ear tips</li>
      <li>Heart Rate Monitoring during workouts</li>
      <li>MagSafe USB-C Charging Case</li>
      <li>IP57 sweat and water resistance</li>
      <li>Seamless connectivity with Apple ecosystem</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:30px; margin-bottom:18px; color:#111;">
      Product Description
    </h2>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      The Apple AirPods Pro 3 is designed to redefine premium wireless audio with improved sound quality,
      smarter features, and enhanced comfort. Powered by Apple’s latest audio technology,
      these earbuds deliver rich bass, detailed vocals, and immersive listening for music,
      movies, gaming, and calls.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Featuring next-generation Active Noise Cancellation, AirPods Pro 3 can reduce external noise significantly,
      allowing you to fully focus on your music or work. Transparency Mode intelligently lets outside sound in
      when needed, creating a more natural listening experience.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Personalized Spatial Audio with dynamic head tracking creates a cinematic surround sound effect,
      making entertainment feel more immersive than ever. The redesigned fit and multiple ear tip sizes provide
      greater comfort and stability during workouts or long listening sessions.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      With improved battery life, sweat and water resistance, fast USB-C charging,
      and deep integration with iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch,
      AirPods Pro 3 delivers one of the best premium wireless earbud experiences available today.
    </p>
