  ('c051c6e1-2862-4f86-83b4-eba35748bf1e', 'M19 TWS', 'm19-tws', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">M19 TWS</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      True Wireless Earbuds with LED Display, Deep Bass & Power Bank Case
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The M19 TWS is a popular budget true wireless earbud designed for everyday use including music, calls, gaming, and online activities.
      It features Bluetooth 5.1 technology for stable wireless connectivity and smooth pairing with smartphones and other devices.
    </p>

    <p>
      Equipped with dynamic drivers, it delivers deep bass, clear vocals, and balanced sound for an enjoyable listening experience.
      The ergonomic in-ear design ensures comfortable use for long hours without discomfort.
    </p>

    <p>
      The charging case comes with a smart LED digital display that shows battery levels, making it easy to monitor power status at any time.
      It also provides extra battery backup for extended usage on the go.
    </p>

    <p>
      With touch control features, users can easily manage music, calls, and voice assistant functions without using their phone.
      Its compact and portable design makes it ideal for travel, workouts, and daily activities.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>Bluetooth 5.1 Stable Connectivity</li>
      <li>Deep Bass Stereo Sound</li>
      <li>LED Digital Battery Display Case</li>
      <li>Smart Touch Control System</li>
      <li>Portable Charging Case with Backup Power</li>
      <li>Comfortable Ergonomic Fit</li>
      <li>Noise Reduction for Clear Calls</li>
      <li>Compatible with Android & iOS</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
