  ('2aedfa84-9b3c-462f-a5a4-3dd49d2e2eb5', 'Hoco M1', 'hoco-m1', '<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; color:#222; line-height:1.8; max-width:1000px; margin:auto;">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div style="text-align:center; padding:30px; background:#f5f5f7; border-radius:15px;">
    <h1 style="font-size:34px; margin-bottom:10px;">Hoco M1</h1>
    <p style="font-size:16px; color:#555;">
      Wired Earphones with Deep Bass, Clear Mic & Comfortable Fit
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Product Description -->
  <div style="padding:25px 10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Product Description</h2>

    <p>
      The Hoco M1 is a classic wired earphone designed for users who want simple, reliable, and high-quality audio performance at an affordable price.
      It features a 14mm dynamic driver that delivers clear stereo sound with enhanced bass for music, videos, and calls.
    </p>

    <p>
      With its 3.5mm audio jack, the Hoco M1 is compatible with most smartphones, laptops, tablets, and PCs,
      making it a universal plug-and-play earphone without needing charging or Bluetooth pairing.
    </p>

    <p>
      The built-in microphone ensures clear voice communication during calls and online meetings.
      Its lightweight and ergonomic design provides comfortable long-term usage without ear fatigue.
    </p>

    <p>
      Durable TPE cable with anti-tangle design ensures long-lasting performance, making it suitable for daily use, travel, study, and entertainment.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Key Features -->
  <div style="padding:10px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Key Features</h2>

    <ul style="padding-left:20px; color:#444;">
      <li>14mm Large Dynamic Driver for Clear Sound</li>
      <li>Deep Bass Stereo Audio Output</li>
      <li>Built-in Microphone for Calls</li>
      <li>3.5mm Universal Audio Jack</li>
      <li>Lightweight & Comfortable Design</li>
      <li>Anti-Tangle Durable TPE Cable</li>
      <li>Noise Isolation Earbud Design</li>
      <li>Compatible with Android, iOS, Laptop & PC</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <!-- Specification Table -->
  <div style="margin-top:20px;">
    <h2 style="font-size:26px;">Specifications</h2>

    <table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:15px;">
      <tr style="background:#111; color:#fff;">
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Feature</th>
        <th style="padding:12px; text-align:left;">Details</th>
      </tr>

