trokes</li>\n<li>Dynamic customizable RGB backlighting</li>\n<li>Premium aluminum frame construction</li>\n<li>6 dedicated programmable macro keys</li>\n<li>Comfortable full-size keyboard layout</li>\n<li>Perfect for gaming and professional use</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\nPackage Includes\n</h3>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\n1 × CORSAIR K100 RGB Gaming Keyboard\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 20px; margin-top: 20px;\">\nProduct Specifications\n</h3>\n\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px;\">\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Brand</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">CORSAIR</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Model</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">K100 RGB</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Switch Type</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">OPX Optical-Mechanical Switch</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Backlighting</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">RGB Lighting</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Keyboard Layout</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">NA Layout</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Macro Keys</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">6 Programmable Macro Keys</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Weight</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">1.31kg</td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\"><b>Color</b></td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #000000; padding:10px;\">Black</td>\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n</div>","reviewCount":0,"originalPrice":28000},"quantity":1},{"product":{"_id":"a4345bc9-